ing, bodies placed outside CM residence\n🔴 https://t.co/LC7VNEGSxO", "url": "https://x.com/5w1hbrief/status/2112390303282065420"}, {"author_id": "2362545770", "created_at": "2026-10-20T03:46:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112390053037310270"], "id": "2112390053037310270", "in_reply_to_user_id": "877035984335941632", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@Jsr_police \nJamshedpur SSP Dr. Ehtesham Waquarib inspected various Durga Puja pandals to review security arrangements. Strict directives were issued to police officials for crowd management, traffic control, and monitoring anti-social elements during the festival.\n\nRead details:", "url": "https://x.com/BJNN02/status/2112390053037310270"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112389992282722305"]}, "author_id": "356369656", "created_at": "2026-10-20T03:46:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112390003670310931"], "id": "2112390003670310931", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Journalism died\n\nWhen for @aajtak attack on a celeb was bigger news (breaking news, discussions) than 19 people killed in Gwalior \nOr the stampede in kolkata\n\nAll 3 tragedies happened at the same time \n\nBut in India a commoners life has no value for media &amp; for gvt. https://t.co/XlTsvKFC3f", "url": "https://x.com/UrbanIndic/status/2112390003670310931"}, {"author_id": "1507019494480572417", "created_at": "2026-10-20T03:41:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112388729918943290"], "id": "2112388729918943290", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1080723811149008896", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 30, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112081887841890681", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@dashman207 Please read the news. D